{
  "_comment": "Synthetic GitHub deliveries. Signatures are HMAC-SHA256 over the exact file bytes using GitHubWebhookSigner.TEST_WEBHOOK_KEY (a public test-only key). Files are stored with -text in .gitattributes so line endings never change.",
